    "_notes": "Edit these if Google changes its markup and the scraper stops finding things. There is deliberately NO 'ao_claim' selector here -- claim-matching is done in Python by walking up from the exact hovered source badge (see get_claims() in google_ai_overview_scraper.py), because Google does not reliably mark 'the currently hovered claim' with any stable attribute.",
    "ao_container": "#eKIzJc",
